      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "本币贷方发生额，币种来自同公司OADM.MainCurncy；保留已存正负号，不ABS、不按DebCred或冲销标记二次翻号。借正贷负净额为Debit-Credit。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/JDT1.html"
